      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，最重要的是──深深信赖并持续磨练\n目白光明的实力，让她的能力继续传承下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a83f37d831e7710496f21c4f6a30dbef8fa76c4d6f8656001c20039568ee7254",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
