    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2bb3047410a3d01fb945f80",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说起来，她正在挑战的距离\n原本就异于其他赛马娘们。\n没错，目白光明她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e64403188c015de8d1a7ccfb0f85e7971874705f6a159d2a6f9b5195e05edc88",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
